(6272532, 927718, 108069, '<td valign="top">Looks like the blue to me. Stunning image. Please leave some notes so us slow people can learn a bit. Truly excellent.</td>', 'Looks like the blue to me. Stunning image. Please leave some notes so us slow people can learn a bit. Truly excellent.', '2011-01-05 18:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6272543, 927504, 108069, '<td valign="top">I really like the works set back like that, and love the horizon city line. But honestly that border is hurting the image. I think you want to draw attention to the fireworks and the horizon line, but the white border lines outshine the horizon line. I want to feel the mystery in the water and the midnight blue sky, but the border is overpowering.<br/> <br/>Just some notes on post processing treatment. I love the actual photo.</td>', 'I really like the works set back like that, and love the horizon city line. But honestly that border is hurting the image. I think you want to draw attention to the fireworks and the horizon line, but the white border lines outshine the horizon line. I want to feel the mystery in the water and the midnight blue sky, but the border is overpowering. Just some notes on post processing treatment. I love the actual photo.', '2011-01-05 18:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
