(6277066, 927580, 120989, '<td valign="top">I am very glad this image made 14th! This is my highest score so far, so thank you all.<br/>A mere coincident that I saw the challenge open after I took this shot. A mere coincident<br/>that I opened my window and saw the fireworks 3 miles away. Camera was ready on tripod, so<br/>got this pic.<br/> <br/>ISO shouldn''t have been set to 1000, it ended up very noisy. However, those noise grains<br/>did give a special appeal.<br/> <br/>Full size image: mit.smugmug.com/Boston-and-Around/Boston-General/13641284_CZzoF#1143114473_NtBML<br/> <br/>Happy New Year to all!<br/> <br/>Manohar<br/></td>', 'I am very glad this image made 14th! This is my highest score so far, so thank you all.A mere coincident that I saw the challenge open after I took this shot. A mere coincidentthat I opened my window and saw the fireworks 3 miles away. Camera was ready on tripod, sogot this pic. ISO shouldn''t have been set to 1000, it ended up very noisy. However, those noise grainsdid give a special appeal. Full size image: mit.smugmug.com/Boston-and-Around/Boston-General/13641284_CZzoF#1143114473_NtBML Happy New Year to all! Manohar', '2011-01-09 03:22:17.000000', NULL, 0),
