(6277278, 927473, 50864, '<td valign="top">I''m so grateful to Don and his ribbons.  If not for him and the posthumous thread I would have missed this beautiful image.  And, nothing like a blue hand to help a person forget (or not care) that they are in brown ribbon country.  Congratulations on a well deserved hand.</td>', 'I''m so grateful to Don and his ribbons.  If not for him and the posthumous thread I would have missed this beautiful image.  And, nothing like a blue hand to help a person forget (or not care) that they are in brown ribbon country.  Congratulations on a well deserved hand.', '2011-01-09 11:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277310, 927556, 102278, '<td valign="top">Yes, i just pipped you! Yours is a lovely shot. Refreshing in B/W.<br/> <br/>Happy New Year to you and yours too Lisa! x</td>', 'Yes, i just pipped you! Yours is a lovely shot. Refreshing in B/W. Happy New Year to you and yours too Lisa! x', '2011-01-09 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277326, 927725, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue! My favorite and top vote (10) from the challenge. One of my all time favorite fireworks shots. Well deserved!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue! My favorite and top vote (10) from the challenge. One of my all time favorite fireworks shots. Well deserved!', '2011-01-09 11:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277328, 927718, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red! Very nicely done!</td>', 'Congrats on the red! Very nicely done!', '2011-01-09 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277331, 927413, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the yellow! Amazing colors.</td>', 'Congrats on the yellow! Amazing colors.', '2011-01-09 11:56:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277334, 927553, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM! The totally red sky is spectacular.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM! The totally red sky is spectacular.', '2011-01-09 11:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277335, 927509, 98022, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Congrats on the HM!', '2011-01-09 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277338, 927515, 98022, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Not your typical fireworks image. Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Not your typical fireworks image. Congrats on the top 10.', '2011-01-09 11:59:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277346, 927718, 1031, '<td valign="top">What really impressed me about this is that I didn''t immediately recognize it as SF. I think the "anonymity" adds to its quality as "art" as compared to "documentary photo" -- not that there''s anything wrong with that ...<br/> <br/>Nice tip about using a long exposure but covering the lens during the burst -- I will try that next time.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'What really impressed me about this is that I didn''t immediately recognize it as SF. I think the "anonymity" adds to its quality as "art" as compared to "documentary photo" -- not that there''s anything wrong with that ... Nice tip about using a long exposure but covering the lens during the burst -- I will try that next time. Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2011-01-09 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277350, 927517, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol, funny - congrats on the brown!</td>', 'lol, funny - congrats on the brown!', '2011-01-09 12:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277351, 927413, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cgino:</b></div><hr/><i> Great scene, great fireworks, the arc of reflections mimicking the bridge makes it for me! That hand in the bridge is pretty crazy too :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Exactly -- that "hand of God" image through the bridge ought to get you published somewhere.</td>', 'Originally posted by cgino: Great scene, great fireworks, the arc of reflections mimicking the bridge makes it for me! That hand in the bridge is pretty crazy too :-)  Exactly -- that "hand of God" image through the bridge ought to get you published somewhere.', '2011-01-09 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277361, 927632, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is spectacular. One of my favs of the challenge.</td>', 'This is spectacular. One of my favs of the challenge.', '2011-01-09 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6277363, 927473, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is so outstanding. I''m glad you got the PH Blue just so it was called to my attention and I got to see it, since I didn''t click through the entire challenge. Uncannily inspired.</td>', 'This is so outstanding. I''m glad you got the PH Blue just so it was called to my attention and I got to see it, since I didn''t click through the entire challenge. Uncannily inspired.', '2011-01-09 12:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
