(6277738, 927725, 11854, '<td valign="top">Congrats! That''s exactly where I was supposed to be at 6pm, but my daughter screwed up my plans by leaving me to babysit early. I didn''t want to do while dragging a 1 year old around. LOL!</td>', 'Congrats! That''s exactly where I was supposed to be at 6pm, but my daughter screwed up my plans by leaving me to babysit early. I didn''t want to do while dragging a 1 year old around. LOL!', '2011-01-09 19:28:24.000000', NULL, 0),
