(6279884, 927718, 66384, '<td valign="top">Big congrats on this stunning shot, and on the ribbon. The processing is very effective and creative. The foreground is more interesting than the fireworks, but they make a spectacular background.</td>', 'Big congrats on this stunning shot, and on the ribbon. The processing is very effective and creative. The foreground is more interesting than the fireworks, but they make a spectacular background.', '2011-01-11 12:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
