(6282568, 927504, 119747, '<td valign="top">This should have done much better! Not sure if its just me but a slight tilted horizon could do with changing but everything else is great! It''s kind of minimalistic and I like it!</td>', 'This should have done much better! Not sure if its just me but a slight tilted horizon could do with changing but everything else is great! It''s kind of minimalistic and I like it!', '2011-01-13 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
